EcoNet DDR calibration
======================

DDR calibration is now stored as source under the per-SoC ``ddr/`` directories.
No DDR binary blob is required in the source tree.

Build the temporary Binman input with one of:

  tools/build-econet-ddr.sh en751221
  tools/build-econet-ddr.sh en7528
  tools/build-econet-ddr.sh en7580

EN751221 requires a big-endian GNU MIPS toolchain. EN7528 and EN7580 require a
little-endian GNU MIPS toolchain. Generated ``*_ddr.bin`` files are build
artifacts and must not be committed.
